{
  "slug": "linkedin-scraper",
  "name": "Linkedin Scraper",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scrape LinkedIn profiles and company pages using Apify actors. Token-efficient LinkedIn data retrieval — routes through a structured scraping MCP to avoid expensive browser screenshot and OCR token usage. Use to get LinkedIn profile data, search for people, or retrieve company information.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `bulk-scrape` (Scrape multiple LinkedIn profiles or company pages in batch), `scrape-company` (Scrape a LinkedIn company page to extract company data including description, size, industry, and recent updates), `scrape-profile` (Scrape a LinkedIn profile to extract professional data including name, headline, work history, education, and skills)\n- **Agents** (1): `linkedin-profile-fetcher` (Fetch structured data from a LinkedIn profile URL, company page, job posting, or person name)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install linkedin-scraper@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/linkedin-scraper`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1
  },
